# Standardized UI API - Complete Implementation Guide

## Overview

The Standardized UI API is a unified system for managing all floating UI components in Juno. It consolidates scattered floating UI variants (bar, panel, chat, etc.) into a single, extensible architecture.

**Status**: ✅ **MIGRATION COMPLETE**
**Backend**: ✅ **All legacy files removed** (floating_bar.rs, floating_panel.rs deleted)
**Frontend**: ✅ **All TypeScript errors resolved**
**Migration**: ✅ **50+ references updated, zero compilation errors**

## Core Architecture

### Frontend Implementation

**Location**: [src/lib/ui-api.ts](mdc:src/lib/ui-api.ts)

The UI API provides a unified interface for all floating UI elements:

```typescript
// Core types
export type UIElementType = "bar" | "panel" | "chat" | "overlay" | "modal";
export type UIState = "default" | "expanding" | "expanded" | "input" | "loading" | "error" | /* 11 more states */;
export type VoiceMode = "idle" | "agent" | "dictation";
export type AgentStatus = "idle" | "working" | "responding" | "finished" | "failed" | "cancelled" | "offline";

// Main UI Manager Class
export class UIElementManager {
  // State management
  async getState(): Promise<UIStateData | null>
  async setState(newState: Partial<UIStateData>): Promise<boolean>

  // Configuration
  async getConfig(): Promise<UIElementConfig | null>
  async setConfig(config: Partial<UIElementConfig>): Promise<boolean>

  // Interactions
  async click(data?: any): Promise<boolean>
  async focus(data?: any): Promise<boolean>
  async blur(data?: any): Promise<boolean>
  async input(value: string): Promise<boolean>
  async submit(query: string): Promise<boolean>

  // Window management
  async resizeWindow(width: number, height: number): Promise<boolean>
  async moveWindow(x: number, y: number): Promise<boolean>
  async setClickThrough(enabled: boolean): Promise<boolean>
}

// React Hook
export function useUIElement(elementId: string, elementType: UIElementType) {
  return {
    manager, state, config,
    click, focus, blur, input, submit,
    resizeWindow, moveWindow, showWindow, hideWindow,
    updateConfig, updateState
  };
}
```

